Pseudocode for Getting an Item

START

Create an empty inventory

WHILE the game is not over

Display the current room
IF the current room contains an item
    Display the item in the room
END IF
Ask the player:
    "Enter a command: get [item]"
Get the player's input
IF the player enters "get" followed by the item in the current room
    Add the item to the player's inventory
    Remove the item from the current room
    Display:
        "You picked up the [item]."
    Display the player's updated inventory
ELSE IF the player enters "get" followed by an item
    that is not in the current room
    Display:
        "That item is not in this room."
ELSE
    Display:
        "Invalid command. Enter get followed by the item name."
END IF

END WHILE

END
